# Leftover Netlify `_redirects` must not be uploaded. Wrangler still
# *parses* dist/_redirects if the file exists (error 100324), so the
# build also deletes dist/ before Vite runs. This ignore is a backup.
_redirects
# The Horizon ships (D15, 2026-09-29): serve the chunked definition — world/<revision>.index.json.gz,
# world/<revision>/<district>.json.gz, the terrain .bin, the cards and the Journey slim land — but never the
# raw world/<revision>.json bake artefact (27.7 MB > Cloudflare's 25 MiB per-file limit; no runtime fetches it).
/horizon/world/horizon-geo-*.json
